168
00:13:32,220 --> 00:13:35,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">"At once" is not a possibility.
In three days.</font>

169
00:13:35,940 --> 00:13:40,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's too long! Go immediately!</font>

170
00:13:40,050 --> 00:13:41,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I do not take orders from you.</font>

171
00:13:41,980 --> 00:13:44,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I said three days, so three days it will be!</font>

172
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:46,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why, you...!</font>

173
00:13:46,590 --> 00:13:49,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's leave this to him.</font>

174
00:14:14,680 --> 00:14:18,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh? I still can't see the top!</font>

175
00:14:20,460 --> 00:14:22,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Faster! Faster!</font>

176
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:09,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's night now...</font>

177
00:15:09,240 --> 00:15:11,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So hungry...</font>

178
00:15:13,920 --> 00:15:16,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Still not there...</font>

179
00:15:16,390 --> 00:15:18,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Maybe I should get a little sleep...</font>

180
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:59,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I should start soon...</font>

181
00:16:03,430 --> 00:16:06,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But I can't go on...</font>

182
00:16:09,770 --> 00:16:12,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Good luck!</i></font>

183
00:16:14,280 --> 00:16:18,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Done already? That was too quick.</i></font>

184
00:16:22,290 --> 00:16:25,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Darn it! I won't lose!</font>

185
00:16:25,120 --> 00:16:28,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll show you by getting even stronger!</font>

186
00:16:28,660 --> 00:16:30,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay!</font>

187
00:16:44,660 --> 00:16:46,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I did it! It's the top!</font>

188
00:17:08,540 --> 00:17:12,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay! Just a little more!</font>

189
00:17:34,090 --> 00:17:36,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I finally made it!</font>

190
00:17:49,620 --> 00:17:54,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I wonder where the
strength-increasing water is...</font>

191
00:17:58,960 --> 00:18:00,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Is this it?</font>

192
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:06,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm here. Come up.</font>

193
00:18:09,460 --> 00:18:14,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yeah! They said a hermit
or somebody lives here...</font>

194
00:18:30,740 --> 00:18:34,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! Hermit! Where are you?!</font>

195
00:18:34,510 --> 00:18:36,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Give me the water!</font>

196
00:18:36,380 --> 00:18:40,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You did well to climb up here.</font>

197
00:18:47,570 --> 00:18:52,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your speed wasn't bad either.
For someone so puny, that is.</font>

198
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:55,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But you're even punier than me!</font>

199
00:18:55,280 --> 00:18:56,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Leave me alone!</font>

200
00:19:01,020 --> 00:19:05,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Say, where's the hermit? Let me see him!</font>

201
00:19:05,580 --> 00:19:08,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I</i> am the Cat Hermit!</font>

202
00:19:08,890 --> 00:19:12,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh?! You're the hermit?!</font>

203
00:19:12,460 --> 00:19:13,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You got a problem with that?</font>

204
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:19,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, technically speaking,
I'm the Hermit Cat...</font>

205
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:21,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, whatever.</font>

206
00:19:21,940 --> 00:19:24,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, is it true that
there's magical water here</font>

207
00:19:24,810 --> 00:19:26,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">that will increase my
strength by several times?</font>

208
00:19:26,810 --> 00:19:29,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I came to drink some of it!</font>

209
00:19:29,080 --> 00:19:32,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let me see... Water that will increase
your strength several-fold?</font>

210
00:19:32,250 --> 00:19:35,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It was called holy something-or-other...</font>

211
00:19:35,620 --> 00:19:38,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You fool. It's called the Super Spirit Water.</font>

212
00:19:38,520 --> 00:19:41,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">See, you know about it!
It's here, isn't it?</font>

213
00:19:42,760 --> 00:19:46,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The Super Spirit Water
is inside that container.</font>

214
00:19:49,630 --> 00:19:52,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Really?! Is that it?!</font>

215
00:19:53,800 --> 00:19:57,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But tell me, why do you seek strength?</font>

216
00:19:57,410 --> 00:19:59,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wouldn't you rather live a peaceful life?</font>

217
00:19:59,940 --> 00:20:04,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, you see, I have
my Grandpa's Dragon Ball,</font>

218
00:20:04,050 --> 00:20:06,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">and there's a boy named Upa,
and his father died, so...</font>

219
00:20:06,320 --> 00:20:08,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, that's enough!</font>

220
00:20:08,450 --> 00:20:10,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It sounds like you're not
very adept at speaking.</font>

221
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:13,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're the one who asked me, though!</font>

222
00:20:13,590 --> 00:20:16,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just remain silent!</font>

223
00:20:30,270 --> 00:20:35,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see. In order to collect the
Dragon Balls and revive Upa's father,</font>

224
00:20:35,340 --> 00:20:40,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">you must first defeat the
assassin known as Tao Pai Pai...</font>

225
00:20:40,450 --> 00:20:44,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How could you tell all that
without me saying anything?!</font>

226
00:20:44,290 --> 00:20:47,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I could not call myself a hermit if I
could not at least read people's minds.</font>

227
00:20:47,620 --> 00:20:51,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Moreover, your mind is
especially easy to read!</font>

228
00:20:51,860 --> 00:20:53,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Amazing!</font>

229
00:20:53,460 --> 00:20:58,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Very well. It would seem
that you bear no ill intention.</font>

230
00:20:58,100 --> 00:20:59,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then it's okay, right?</font>

231
00:21:03,070 --> 00:21:05,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm going to drink some of this!</font>

232
00:21:09,210 --> 00:21:12,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is it. I wonder what the
Super Spirit Water's like...</font>

233
00:21:12,780 --> 00:21:14,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you think you can drink it?</font>

234
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:17,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh?! Does it taste that bad?!</font>

235
00:21:17,550 --> 00:21:20,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- It doesn't taste bad, but...
- Then I should be fine.</font>

236
00:21:34,400 --> 00:21:36,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What was that for?!</font>

237
00:21:36,570 --> 00:21:42,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, don't mind me.
Drink as much water as you like.</font>

238
00:21:42,810 --> 00:21:45,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So let me drink some, then!</font>

239
00:21:50,310 --> 00:21:53,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You said I could have some! You're a liar!</font>

240
00:21:53,390 --> 00:21:57,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sure, drink up. If you
can get past me, that is.</font>

241
00:21:57,030 --> 00:21:58,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, then!</font>

242
00:22:05,780 --> 00:22:10,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can read your mind; do you think
I would fall for a trick like that?</font>

243
00:22:10,520 --> 00:22:12,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ow!</font>

244
00:22:14,980 --> 00:22:17,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here it is!</font>

245
00:22:17,280 --> 00:22:19,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Over here!</font>

246
00:22:19,790 --> 00:22:23,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now I'm mad! I'll take it by force, then!</font>

247
00:22:23,990 --> 00:22:25,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come and get it!</font>

248
00:23:00,130 --> 00:23:01,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Darn it!</font>

249
00:23:22,680 --> 00:23:25,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">H-He's too fast!</font>

250
00:23:25,620 --> 00:23:28,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">At this rate, you could spend your
whole life and still never catch me!</font>

251
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:31,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You aren't reading your
opponent's moves at all.</font>

252
00:23:31,660 --> 00:23:33,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're just being reckless.</font>

253
00:23:33,860 --> 00:23:35,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

254
00:23:56,660 --> 00:23:59,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's this? Worn out already?</font>

255
00:24:02,530 --> 00:24:08,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Say, has anybody ever climbed up
here and drunk your water before?</font>

256
00:24:08,470 --> 00:24:12,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There was one.
Only one person, 300 years ago.</font>

257
00:24:16,910 --> 00:24:20,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Just how old are you?</font>

258
00:24:20,710 --> 00:24:23,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A little over 800 years old.</font>

259
00:24:23,510 --> 00:24:26,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're way, way older than me, then?</font>

260
00:24:26,920 --> 00:24:29,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So show some respect!</font>

261
00:24:29,420 --> 00:24:32,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Allow me to tell you.</font>

262
00:24:32,320 --> 00:24:36,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The one who was able to
drink the holy water was...</font>

263
00:24:43,880 --> 00:24:46,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...your master.</font>

264
00:24:46,180 --> 00:24:48,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh?! What do you mean?!</font>

265
00:24:48,610 --> 00:24:51,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can tell by the way you move.</font>

266
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:54,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your master is Muten Roshi, right?</font>

267
00:24:54,890 --> 00:24:59,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You mean Old-timer Turtle Hermit
came here a long time ago?!</font>

268
00:24:59,190 --> 00:25:03,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He drank the magical water
here and got even stronger?!</font>

269
00:25:03,530 --> 00:25:06,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's right.</font>

270
00:25:06,530 --> 00:25:11,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">D-Does that mean you're
a really important person?!</font>

271
00:25:11,400 --> 00:25:14,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now do you understand?
From now on, call me Karin-<i>sama</i>!</font>

272
00:25:14,770 --> 00:25:20,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How long did it take Old-timer Turtle
Hermit to steal that water jar?</font>

273
00:25:22,910 --> 00:25:25,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wow, three minutes?!</font>

274
00:25:25,780 --> 00:25:28,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No. Three years.</font>

275
00:25:37,590 --> 00:25:39,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Goku-san</i>...</font>

276
00:25:47,200 --> 00:25:49,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-Three years?!</font>

277
00:25:57,880 --> 00:26:04,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>If it took the Turtle Hermit three years,</i>
<i>just how long will it take Goku?!</i></font>

278
00:26:28,430 --> 00:26:31,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oide fantaji</i></font>

279
00:26:28,430 --> 00:26:31,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Come along, fantasy</i></font>

280
00:26:31,340 --> 00:26:33,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Suki sa misuteri</i></font>

281
00:26:31,340 --> 00:26:33,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I enjoy a mystery</i></font>

282
00:26:33,940 --> 00:26:40,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kimi no wakasa kakusanai de</i></font>

283
00:26:33,940 --> 00:26:40,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Don't you go hiding your youth!</i></font>

284
00:26:40,510 --> 00:26:43,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Fushigi shitakute</i></font>

285
00:26:40,510 --> 00:26:43,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to perform the mysterious</i></font>

286
00:26:43,520 --> 00:26:46,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Boken shitakute</i></font>

287
00:26:43,520 --> 00:26:46,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Wanting to pursue the adventure</i></font>

288
00:26:46,020 --> 00:26:52,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Dare mo min'na uzu-uzu shite 'ru</i></font>

289
00:26:46,020 --> 00:26:52,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Everyone is itching to go!</i></font>

290
00:26:52,020 --> 00:26:58,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Otona no furi shite akiramecha</i></font>

291
00:26:52,020 --> 00:26:58,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you act like an adult and give up</i></font>

292
00:26:58,030 --> 00:27:04,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kiseki no nazo nado tokenai yo</i></font>

293
00:26:58,030 --> 00:27:04,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>You'll never unravel the mystery of the miracle!</i></font>

294
00:27:04,200 --> 00:27:15,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Motto wairudo ni motto takumashiku ikite goran</i></font>

295
00:27:04,200 --> 00:27:15,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Go on and try to live</i>
<i>even more wild and strong!</i></font>

296
00:27:15,310 --> 00:27:22,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

297
00:27:15,310 --> 00:27:22,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

298
00:27:22,890 --> 00:27:27,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Honto no yuki misete kuretara</i></font>

299
00:27:22,890 --> 00:27:27,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>If you will show me your true courage</i></font>

300
00:27:27,390 --> 00:27:34,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Romantikku ageru yo, romantikku ageru yo</i></font>

301
00:27:27,390 --> 00:27:34,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give you a romance,</i>
<i>I'll give you a romance</i></font>

302
00:27:34,770 --> 00:27:43,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Tokimeku mune ni</i>
<i>kira-kira hikatta yume o ageru yo</i></font>

303
00:27:34,770 --> 00:27:43,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I'll give your pounding heart</i>
<i>a glittery, shining dream!</i></font>

